Template: lynceus-agent/host
Type: string
Default: 127.0.0.1
Description: Lynceus server address:
 Hostname or IP address of the Lynceus server this agent reports to.

Template: lynceus-agent/port
Type: string
Default: 8000
Description: Lynceus server port:
 Port the Lynceus server listens on.

Template: lynceus-agent/key
Type: password
Description: Lynceus API key:
 Leave empty if the server does not have LYNCEUS_API_KEY set.

Template: lynceus-agent/tls
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Connect over TLS?
 Use wss instead of ws when connecting to the server.